{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52319","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男婚藉嘉偶，女娉希好仇。\n但令捉如息，何尤无公侯。\n菩萨常梳发，如来不剃头。\n何须秃兀硉，怨（项校「然」）始学薰修。\n荣官赤赫赫，灭族黄发人（郭谓「人」爲叠字符号）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}